capybara in his arms.\nThe capybara has narrow eyes, or rather, the type with closed eyes often seen in mascots.\nShe is wearing a blue hoodie, apron and cargo pants. You do not need to wear shoes.\nThe capibara is about the size of a stuffed animal up to the knees. It is only plush-like, not a stuffed animal.\nIt's more like my current icon.\nFor reference.\nhttps://x.com/maki_blue415/status/1540741895608864770?s=46&t=Bh9Bgzorz5pvs1Os_4N2HQ\n\nI have no problem with the production scene being played on the distribution.\nIs there anything missing? I hope not.\nBest regards.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 2695939, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4aeaa1d8/uploads/origins/f14889a6-6140-4bbd-992d-59ad960c2b5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78787299276cbda6ce873dd327757b36", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4aeaa1d8/uploads/origins/f14889a6-6140-4bbd-992d-59ad960c2b5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78787299276cbda6ce873dd327757b36, https://si.imgix.net/4aeaa1d8/uploads/origins/f14889a6-6140-4bbd-992d-59ad960c2b5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cac842b9e546edbd4e65a4261935956b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4aeaa1d8/uploads/origins/f14889a6-6140-4bbd-992d-59ad960c2b5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31b8eb45bd499afd95d25e834d62e4f2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4aeaa1d8/uploads/origins/f14889a6-6140-4bbd-992d-59ad960c2b5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=82149e47e2809eec78ba1b3dee90be31", "srcset": "https://si